                            <comment id="430044" author="adilger" created="Thu, 3 Oct 2024 03:37:09 +0000">&lt;p&gt;This is likely the same issue as &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18299" title="runtests test_1: FAIL: Space not all freed: now 28784kB, was 28448kB" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18299"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-18299&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, where a small amount of data was not freed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="430804" author="yujian" created="Wed, 9 Oct 2024 23:14:52 +0000">&lt;p&gt;The failure occurred twice since 2024-09-28.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="502776" author="adilger" created="Mon, 5 Oct 2026 21:04:29 +0000">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="error"&gt;&amp;#91;Claude&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; has not failed since 2026-03-19, most recent failure was &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/e867fc42-421f-4924-a80d-a3e82d2d57bc" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/e867fc42-421f-4924-a80d-a3e82d2d57bc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="505738" author="adilger" created="Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:57:12 +0000">&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=patrickbot" class="user-hover" rel="patrickbot"&gt;patrickbot&lt;/a&gt; it looks like this subtest started failing again recently, when it hadn't for the previous 90 days.  Please investigate RCA and develop a patch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="505739" author="JIRAUSER24100" created="Fri, 13 Nov 2026 02:01:13 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Patrick-Bot: &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=adilger" class="user-hover" rel="adilger"&gt;adilger&lt;/a&gt; OK, I'll do that, in run pw-ticket-&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18304" title="replay-single test_89: FAIL: kbytesfree 53797724 &amp;gt; 53797180 + margin 224" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18304"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-18304&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;-8333941666ab, and comment here when it is done.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="505740" author="JIRAUSER24100" created="Fri, 13 Nov 2026 02:44:57 +0000">&lt;p&gt;Patrick-Bot: &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=adilger" class="user-hover" rel="adilger"&gt;adilger&lt;/a&gt; Regression from e5911ebb15 (&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20076" title="reduce testing time by optimizing test and test-framework.sh" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-20076"&gt;LU-20076&lt;/a&gt;), ZFS only. CI OSS logs show the 40 MiB file is fully freed after the single force_sync, but the remounted OST0000 still reads 8 MiB under 'before', past the 4 MiB margin. The old 10s of sleeps hid this; the statfs caches are not the cause. The fix is already in review: &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/c/70738" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/70738&lt;/a&gt; retries the check for up to 10s.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;(run pw-ticket-&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-18304" title="replay-single test_89: FAIL: kbytesfree 53797724 &amp;gt; 53797180 + margin 224" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-18304"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-18304&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;-8333941666ab)&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
